cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "When Retrieval Fails: Silent and Loud Failure Modes in Retrieval-Augmented Generation"
abstract: >-
  A controlled study of what retrieval-augmented generation does when retrieval
  degrades: whether it abstains (safe failure) or asserts unsupported claims
  (silent failure), and whether that outcome can be predicted from retrieval-side
  signals before the generator is called.
type: software
